   "izenburua": "66. ariketa — <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>α</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mfrac><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></math>: kasu-azterketa <math display=\"inline\"><mi>α</mi></math>-ren arabera (2013-05-29)",
